kosmos-samba-mods for Debian

This package pre-configures Samba enabling automatic users home sharing
with write permission.

It also sets the primary user (first UID >= 1000) samba share password to the
default:

  KosmOSamb@

User can (and should) change it with:

  > smbpasswd

